521 0 obj
<</ActualText(Magic: The Gathering Collection Manager\nCross-Platform Mobile Application\nReact Native " TypeScript " Expo " REST APIs " Jest\n2025 - Present\n\nDesigned and developed a cross-platform mobile application that helps users scan, organize, and manage Magic\
: The Gathering collections while simplifying deck building and collection management through intelligent automation and user-centered design.\n\nKey Contributions\nBuilt a cross-platform mobile application using React Native, TypeScript, and Expo.\nDesig\
ned the complete end-to-end user experience for collection management, OCR scanning, manual correction workflows, deck building, and AI-assisted features.\nIntegrated the Scryfall REST API and designed client-side data handling to support intelligent sear\
ch, caching, and real-time collection management.\nDeveloped OCR-powered recognition workflows featuring exact matching, intelligent fallback search logic, and manual correction to improve scan reliability.\nArchitected modular service layers and reusable\
 UI components to improve maintainability, scalability, and future feature development.\nImplemented caching strategies and optimized frontend data handling to improve recognition speed and application performance.\nWrote automated Jest tests covering rec\
ognition services, caching logic, and application workflows.)/K 17/P 520 0 R/Pg 544 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
